; The same context-export defect as elimination-context-export.smt2, reached
; through the DEFAULT configuration rather than a forced one.
;
; Automatic engagement holds a QF_BV session on the batch pipeline until its
; thirty-second real solve, so the shape above is only reachable with no
; flags at all after enough warm-up checks. That is the configuration users
; get, and it is the one no other test in this directory exercises: of the
; suite's RUN lines, all but a handful force --incremental, whose first-solve
; paths the default policy never takes.
;
; The warm-up rounds are deliberately trivial and independent of the payload.
; RUN: %solver %s | %OutputCheck %s
; RUN: %solver --check-sanity %s | %OutputCheck %s
